  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34676078",
      "title": "Setting Page Response Headers",
      "lectureOrder": 106,
      "videoOrder": 99,
      "sourceHash": "0f47899eb9056f88029561845db9270c023fda385e0c941fadfb087971c5684a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.7,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "So when it comes to attaching response headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 6.72,
          "en": "you get a couple of options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.72,
          "end": 9.93,
          "en": "You can, for example, go to your entry dot server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.93,
          "end": 13.17,
          "en": "dot JSX file, which is the main entry file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "for all requests that reach this server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 17.613,
          "en": "this Remix driven server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 22.808,
          "en": "There you will find some place where one header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.808,
          "end": 25.11,
          "en": "is already being set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.11,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "Here in this handle browser request function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 28.65,
          "en": "for me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.65,
          "end": 30.78,
          "en": "Here, the content type for all these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.78,
          "end": 34.08,
          "en": "page requests is set to text slash html",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.08,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "because all these page requests get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 38.523,
          "en": "finished HTML pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "Now you could add more headers here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 43.29,
          "en": "if you wanted to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.29,
          "end": 44.347,
          "en": "like X my header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.347,
          "end": 45.66,
          "en": "like X my header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.66,
          "end": 50.58,
          "en": "to not clash with any built-in header, some value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 53.28,
          "en": "We could set our own custom header like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.28,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "And now if I reload this page and we inspect this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "request for this page, we find our custom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 61.083,
          "en": "header here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 64.53,
          "en": "So that's one way of adding a header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.53,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "This approach ensures that this header is added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 71.413,
          "en": "to all pages, and that might sometimes be what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.413,
          "end": 75.87,
          "en": "you want, but in many cases it's not what you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "You might, for example, want to control the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 82.77,
          "en": "caching of pages by adding the cache control header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.77,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "Now here, you don't wanna set one cache setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 87.78,
          "en": "for all your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.78,
          "end": 89.88,
          "en": "Instead, it's very page specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 92.7,
          "en": "how a page should be cached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.7,
          "end": 95.55,
          "en": "For example, our starting page index jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 97.28999999999999,
          "en": "in the marketing folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 101.31,
          "en": "Here we have a page with no dynamic content at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.31,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "It's not going to change very frequently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 105.45,
          "en": "and therefore we can probably cache",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.45,
          "end": 107.49000000000001,
          "en": "it for a long time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.49000000000001,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "On the other hand, this page with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 111.87,
          "en": "our list of expenses changes all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.87,
          "end": 115.878,
          "en": "We probably don't wanna cache that for a long time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.878,
          "end": 119.49000000000001,
          "en": "So therefore, we wanna add page specific headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.49000000000001,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "and we can do that with help of another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 124.143,
          "en": "useful function provided by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 128.935,
          "en": "Remix provides us with the headers function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.935,
          "end": 132.54,
          "en": "which we can export just as we export meta or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.54,
          "end": 135.897,
          "en": "links or action or loader, and we export this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.897,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "inside of our route components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 140.193,
          "en": "So here in index jsx, in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.32999999999998,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "Headers then should return an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "where you specify your headers that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 148.68,
          "en": "should be added to the page response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.68,
          "end": 151.07999999999998,
          "en": "as key value pairs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.07999999999998,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "For example, you could add the cache control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 156.32999999999998,
          "en": "header and set it to max age",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 160.885,
          "en": "3,600 which would be 60 minutes to give the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.885,
          "end": 164.82,
          "en": "and anyone else who's interested, the extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 168.51,
          "en": "that this page can be cached for up to 60 minutes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.51,
          "end": 171.84300000000002,
          "en": "and only thereafter a fresh copy should be requested.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.19,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "If we do that, and I go back to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "the starting page and reload there, and reloading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 181.98,
          "en": "is important, so that a new request is sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.98,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "and I then inspect this initial request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 188.82,
          "en": "you see that there, indeed I do have this response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 190.26,
          "en": "Now because of that if you now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.26,
          "end": 193.05,
          "en": "make a change on this page, for example, a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.05,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "of exclamation marks here, you would not see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 199.62,
          "en": "change if this wouldn't be in development here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.62,
          "end": 202.59,
          "en": "Here in development, we actually get a reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.59,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "despite us adding this cache control header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 208.44,
          "en": "But in production, we would have caching here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.44,
          "end": 210.66,
          "en": "and this cache setting would ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.66,
          "end": 213.81,
          "en": "that we only see page updates after this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 213.81,
          "end": 216.633,
          "en": "one hour for which the page was cached at most.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
